  "text": "An executive assistant works within a connected system. The executive makes decisions within their authority. Finance, operations and other specialists remain responsible for their own decisions. The executive protection officer and independent control room also have defined responsibilities. Your role is to organise dependable support, make missing information visible and obtain the decisions or acceptance that an arrangement requires. This course does not give you specialist powers or replace your workplace mandate.",
